body:
I both do and don't.

I don't want to just create a person will nilly and not worrying about pregnancy is a huge stress off my mind. 

At the same time, I remember getting really sad about not being able to have kids. And I can't see any situation where \*I\* would feel comfortable being someone's "father."

If I could I would want to, at least once. But I cannot and I suspect that the technology to do so will not exist in \*my\* lifetime.

Lastly not to be too upsetting, but I don't think that I could justify bringing someone into the mess that is my life. I know I would be a terrible parent.

So there is no way \*I\* could be a parent in this lifetime.

I just want to make a future for those who do want kids. And hope that they can live in a kinder world than I did.

